    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Mana sphere, caster level 9th.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You can spend an additional spell point when using Spellburn to increase the initial spell point damage by 1d4, and the spell point damage for being spellburned each round by 2, plus 2 for every 6 caster levels you possess beyond 9th.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mana#toc99\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
